@startuml
title Download：下载授权与审计模块（skeleton）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "api" {
  interface DownloadAuthorizationService {
    +authorizeDownload(command, actor, client)
  }
  interface DownloadAuditQueryService {
    +searchDownloadAudits(query)
    +getDownloadStatistics(query)
  }
  interface DeliveryResultRecorder {
    +recordDeliveryResult(command)
  }
  class DownloadCommand <<record>>
  class DownloadGrant <<record>>
  class DownloadAuditSummary <<record>>
  class DownloadStatistics <<record>>
}
package "application" {
  class MockDownload <<skeleton mock>>
}
interface "DownloadAssetLookup\n(AssetIndex API)" as AssetLookup

MockDownload ..|> DownloadAuthorizationService
MockDownload ..|> DownloadAuditQueryService
MockDownload ..|> DeliveryResultRecorder
MockDownload --> AssetLookup : 按 assetId 查询可下载资产
MockDownload ..> DownloadGrant : 授权结果
MockDownload ..> DownloadAuditSummary : 审计记录

note bottom
当前只模拟“授权”，不会实际发送 NetCDF 文件。
生产环境由 Nginx 根据内部路径传输文件。
end note
@enduml
